{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-05-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC EVOLUT™ TAVR SYSTEM SHOWS STRONG PERFORMANCE AT TWO YEARS IN LOW RISK TRIAL', 'text': 'DUBLIN, MAY 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETE TWO-YEAR OUTCOMES FROM THE LANDMARK EVOLUT LOW RISK TRIAL COMPARING THE MINIMALLY INVASIVE EVOLUT™ TRANSCATHETER AORTIC VALVE REPLACEMENT (TAVR) SYSTEM TO THE GOLD STANDARD OF OPEN-HEART SURGERY IN CHARACTERISTICALLY YOUNGER, HEALTHIER AORTIC STENOSIS PATIENTS.\xa0PRESENTED VIRTUALLY TODAY AS A LATE-BREAKING CLINICAL TRIAL AT THE EUROPCR 2021 E-COURSE, RESULTS SHOWED THE EVOLUT TAVR PLATFORM WAS NON INFERIOR TO SURGERY FOR THE PRIMARY ENDPOINT OF ALL-CAUSE MORTALITY OR DISABLING STROKE AT TWO YEARS (4.3% FOR TAVR VERSUS 6.3% FOR SURGERY; P< 0.0001 FOR NON-INFERIORITY), AND TRENDED THE SAME OR LOWER ON ALL CRITICAL EVENTS, CONFIRMING THE EARLIER BAYESIAN STATISTICAL ANALYSIS PRESENTED AT THE AMERICAN COLLEGE OF CARDIOLOGY (ACC) 68TH ANNUAL SCIENTIFIC SESSION IN 2019.'}
